NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the SOFTWARE in this repository: the CLI, resolvers,
crosswalk, validation code and tests.

It does NOT cover the registry data in registry/, which is released separately
under CC0 1.0 — see registry/LICENSE.

It does NOT cover third-party material. Verbatim quotations of data-availability
statements in registry entries are short factual quotations used for
identification and attribution, and remain the property of their publishers.
No publisher supplementary file is redistributed in this repository; test
fixtures are derived extracts (accession and identifier columns only) with the
parent file's sha256 recorded for traceability.
